# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

@gov_north
new-page: true
style: gov-scene

[+ government_tabs +]

- @northern_infrastructure1
- @SaskForest_conversion
- @SaskTrading_conversion
- @northern_qol

@northern_infrastructure1
title: Uranium City Highway
subtitle: Currently, many northern communities are accessible only by ice road; begin the construction of a highway to uranium city and subsidiary roads to adjacent towns

@SaskForest_conversion
title: Economic Decentralization
subtitle: Continue the de-centralization of the northern economy with the conversion of Saskatchewan Forest and Lakes Products into consumer cooperatives

@SaskTrading_conversion
title: Economic Decentralization
subtitle: Continue the decentralization of the northern economy with the conversion of Saskatchewan Government Trading Services into a retail cooperative

@northern_qol
title: Raise Northern Living Standards
subtitle: Implement wide-ranging policies in the north to raise the standard of living; housing programs, local road improvements, renovation of public buildings, and expanding access to Kindergarten for Indigenous children



